            "text": "<p>After checkout, the digital gift card code will be sent to you via email. You'll receive a special link to view your gift card, print it, or copy the code that can be used to make purchases on our website. To send your gift, just forward the email or the page link, or give your recipient the printed gift card page. You will not receive a physical gift card after purchase.<br/></p>"
